<title>UK: Hamburg Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburg Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint leads Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Commerzbank, DG Bank and Bayerische Hypothekenbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN HAMBURG AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.5	 MATURITY    02.OCT.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.72     PAY DATE   *22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	LISTING    HAMBURG   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	*PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.06	SELL CONC  0.19	DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
